{"articleNo":"519706","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=519706&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학원] (장학) 2025학년도 1학기 일반대학원 미래인재육성장학금 지급 안내","writer":"대학원학사지원실","writeDate":"2025.07.16","hit":"6156","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">2025</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">학년도&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">1</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">학기 일반대학원 미래인재육성장학금(전일제 1~2학기차)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">지급 안내</span></div><div><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b style=\"font-family: Noto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- 대상: 일반대학원 전일제 1~2학기차 재학생 중 1) 장학금 신청서 및 2) 전일제 관련 서류 제출 완료자</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">지급일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">: 2025. 7. 22.(화) 입금 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; *</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;장학금 입금은 Onekit에 장학금지급계좌로 등록(2025.7.15.기준 등록계좌)되어 있는 계좌로 입금</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><br></span></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">장학금액 확인방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">: Onekit -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">통합정보시스템&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">학생서비스&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">학사행정&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">장학&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">장학금 수혜내역조회</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; *&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">장학금액은 유선으로 안내되지 않습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. Onekit</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">을 통하여 학생 본인이 직접 확인 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">장학금을 수령한 학생 중<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"> 한국장학재단 대출(등록금 대출)을 받은 학생의 경우&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; 장학금으로 \"반드시\" 한국장학재단 대출금을 상환하시기 합니다</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">상환방법 및 금액</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">문의는 한국장학재단으로 하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">등록금액에 대하여 장학금과 대출금으로 이중 수령한 경우, 이후 대출 및 장학생 선발에 영향을 미칠수 있음을 안내 드립니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
